(7276336, 1132898, 67258, '<td valign="top">Up there in my top 3.</td>', 'Up there in my top 3.', '2014-10-23 02:31:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7276394, 1132898, 65234, '<td valign="top">Good heavens, the bokeh, the gorgeous sunburst, that perfectly textured leaf ... love this!  Maybe a tad of haloing but I think that''s more backlighting than sharpening artifacts.  My kind of beauty :-)</td>', 'Good heavens, the bokeh, the gorgeous sunburst, that perfectly textured leaf ... love this!  Maybe a tad of haloing but I think that''s more backlighting than sharpening artifacts.  My kind of beauty :-)', '2014-10-23 09:21:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7276395, 1132697, 65234, '<td valign="top">Not an out of the box use of the technique, but a really lovely one.  Soft and sharp in all the right places and a very dignified portrait.</td>', 'Not an out of the box use of the technique, but a really lovely one.  Soft and sharp in all the right places and a very dignified portrait.', '2014-10-23 09:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7276396, 1133010, 65234, '<td valign="top">This one just appeals to me.  I love looking at it in detail, and the overall image is out of this world.  The OOF bird is what really makes it for me, I think.  Just love that fanned tail looking slightly transparent, and then my eye easily drifts up on a diagonal to the other bird''s eye.</td>', 'This one just appeals to me.  I love looking at it in detail, and the overall image is out of this world.  The OOF bird is what really makes it for me, I think.  Just love that fanned tail looking slightly transparent, and then my eye easily drifts up on a diagonal to the other bird''s eye.', '2014-10-23 09:27:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7276397, 1132981, 65234, '<td valign="top">Perfect DOF for this subject.  Very nice bokeh, too.</td>', 'Perfect DOF for this subject.  Very nice bokeh, too.', '2014-10-23 09:27:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7276399, 1132687, 65234, '<td valign="top">Hi, spider!  There are about a gazillion out spinning huge webs around here.  Love the detail on this one, and the DOF is spot on for the subject.  Tough to get just the right bodyparts in focus on a bug!</td>', 'Hi, spider!  There are about a gazillion out spinning huge webs around here.  Love the detail on this one, and the DOF is spot on for the subject.  Tough to get just the right bodyparts in focus on a bug!', '2014-10-23 09:29:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7276401, 1132990, 65234, '<td valign="top">Considering a bonus point for amazing alliteration ;-)  Nicely detailed squirrel and nice bokeh and greenery to set him off.</td>', 'Considering a bonus point for amazing alliteration ;-)  Nicely detailed squirrel and nice bokeh and greenery to set him off.', '2014-10-23 09:30:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7276403, 1132968, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very appealing to me.  Like the composition and the gorgeous bokeh, especially in that lower left corner.</td>', 'Very appealing to me.  Like the composition and the gorgeous bokeh, especially in that lower left corner.', '2014-10-23 09:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7276404, 1132959, 65234, '<td valign="top">Pretty shapes and nice composition.</td>', 'Pretty shapes and nice composition.', '2014-10-23 09:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7276406, 1132822, 65234, '<td valign="top">Looks like he''s contemplating a jump.  Nicely composed; would like the bug lightened a bit so I can see more detail on him.</td>', 'Looks like he''s contemplating a jump.  Nicely composed; would like the bug lightened a bit so I can see more detail on him.', '2014-10-23 09:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7276407, 1132966, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice use of the DOF to hone in on the gator in a sea of green.</td>', 'Nice use of the DOF to hone in on the gator in a sea of green.', '2014-10-23 09:33:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7276408, 1132888, 65234, '<td valign="top">Aww, what a cutie!  The leaves are a nice backdrop for him/her.</td>', 'Aww, what a cutie!  The leaves are a nice backdrop for him/her.', '2014-10-23 09:34:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7276409, 1132960, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nah, she''s just cleaning her leg at the moment.  Love mantisses :-)  You got a good angle on this one.</td>', 'Nah, she''s just cleaning her leg at the moment.  Love mantisses :-)  You got a good angle on this one.', '2014-10-23 09:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7276411, 1132628, 65234, '<td valign="top">The light through the wattle is something else ;-)  Like the perfect isolation from the background and the diagonals to it.  Personally, I''d have lightened the eye to bring out the detail a bit more.</td>', 'The light through the wattle is something else ;-)  Like the perfect isolation from the background and the diagonals to it.  Personally, I''d have lightened the eye to bring out the detail a bit more.', '2014-10-23 09:37:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7276412, 1132922, 65234, '<td valign="top">Lovely Autumnal image.  Colorful leaves make for great backgrounds, and I like the light through the foreground leaves.</td>', 'Lovely Autumnal image.  Colorful leaves make for great backgrounds, and I like the light through the foreground leaves.', '2014-10-23 09:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7276413, 1132677, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective and composition.</td>', 'Nice perspective and composition.', '2014-10-23 09:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7276414, 1132729, 65234, '<td valign="top">Pretty bird, perfectly isolated from the background.  Love the detail here.</td>', 'Pretty bird, perfectly isolated from the background.  Love the detail here.', '2014-10-23 09:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7276415, 1133012, 65234, '<td valign="top">I do love shallow DOF flowers, and weedy ones are awesome.  Debating a bit on whether I would have cropped off the top third of the image.  The colors are pretty, but the image "feels" stronger to me cropped tighter.</td>', 'I do love shallow DOF flowers, and weedy ones are awesome.  Debating a bit on whether I would have cropped off the top third of the image.  The colors are pretty, but the image "feels" stronger to me cropped tighter.', '2014-10-23 09:40:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7276416, 1132844, 65234, '<td valign="top">Well executed.  You got some nice bokeh on the OOF pieces.</td>', 'Well executed.  You got some nice bokeh on the OOF pieces.', '2014-10-23 09:41:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7276417, 1132920, 65234, '<td valign="top">At least there''s no blood!  Great DOF and perspective.</td>', 'At least there''s no blood!  Great DOF and perspective.', '2014-10-23 09:41:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7276418, 1132994, 65234, '<td valign="top">Really makes me want to know what is so fascinating over there. Nicely done.</td>', 'Really makes me want to know what is so fascinating over there. Nicely done.', '2014-10-23 09:42:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7276419, 1132921, 65234, '<td valign="top">Not my sister!  Focus on the head is sharp where it matters.  Lighting is a bit harsh, which makes the shadows and the legs equally dark on my monitor.</td>', 'Not my sister!  Focus on the head is sharp where it matters.  Lighting is a bit harsh, which makes the shadows and the legs equally dark on my monitor.', '2014-10-23 09:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7276420, 1132763, 65234, '<td valign="top">Adorable perspective!  It''s not often a bee''s head looks big in comparison to the flower it''s drinking from.</td>', 'Adorable perspective!  It''s not often a bee''s head looks big in comparison to the flower it''s drinking from.', '2014-10-23 09:45:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7276422, 1132371, 65234, '<td valign="top">Fun shadows and lighting.  Kind of want to crop it tighter for more detail on fewer leaves, and get a bit more room on top so it''s a more vertical composition.  Or crop off about the top half.  I dunno''; something about the composition just isn''t working for me.</td>', 'Fun shadows and lighting.  Kind of want to crop it tighter for more detail on fewer leaves, and get a bit more room on top so it''s a more vertical composition.  Or crop off about the top half.  I dunno''; something about the composition just isn''t working for me.', '2014-10-23 09:50:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7276423, 1133000, 65234, '<td valign="top">Looks like a Morning Glory bud.  Love the soft twists and the bokeh here is nice.</td>', 'Looks like a Morning Glory bud.  Love the soft twists and the bokeh here is nice.', '2014-10-23 09:51:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7276425, 1132846, 65234, '<td valign="top">It glows!  Love the light here.  Nitpicky to want a starburst on the water drop but man, that would really make this spectacular.   As it is, it''s very good :-)</td>', 'It glows!  Love the light here.  Nitpicky to want a starburst on the water drop but man, that would really make this spectacular.   As it is, it''s very good :-)', '2014-10-23 09:52:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7276428, 1132679, 65234, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful little world!  That leafy bokeh in the background is just fantastic.  Adds lots of atmosphere to the image.  Looks a little noisy on my monitor, but not enough to really bother me.</td>', 'What a wonderful little world!  That leafy bokeh in the background is just fantastic.  Adds lots of atmosphere to the image.  Looks a little noisy on my monitor, but not enough to really bother me.', '2014-10-23 09:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
