(7277085, 1132679, 174999, '<td valign="top">One of my top fav 10.. not only is this great DOF but I love the background as well.. very well done! This photo just pulls me right into it and is really capturing</td>', 'One of my top fav 10.. not only is this great DOF but I love the background as well.. very well done! This photo just pulls me right into it and is really capturing', '2014-10-25 10:40:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7277093, 1132981, 174999, '<td valign="top">This is one of those photos where  when I first looked at it, I really didn''t care for it. After a while, it turned out to be just the opposite... the more I looked at it the more  I fell in love with it.. I was just really captured by the DOF on this and the way the leaves and how this leaf just lays on the pine tree just really pulls it off really nice.. actually ended up to be one of my favorites! Well done.. I love photos like this where it really makes you stop and look at it and to really appreciate the simplicity of things..</td>', 'This is one of those photos where  when I first looked at it, I really didn''t care for it. After a while, it turned out to be just the opposite... the more I looked at it the more  I fell in love with it.. I was just really captured by the DOF on this and the way the leaves and how this leaf just lays on the pine tree just really pulls it off really nice.. actually ended up to be one of my favorites! Well done.. I love photos like this where it really makes you stop and look at it and to really appreciate the simplicity of things..', '2014-10-25 10:43:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7277098, 1132968, 174999, '<td valign="top">LOVE! This just captured me as the details of the the raindrops just pulled off the details... really different kind of composition you just don''t see every day, and done on the DOF and lighting on this really makes it is supurb!</td>', 'LOVE! This just captured me as the details of the the raindrops just pulled off the details... really different kind of composition you just don''t see every day, and done on the DOF and lighting on this really makes it is supurb!', '2014-10-25 10:46:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7277103, 1132544, 174999, '<td valign="top">Great photo but wish the feathers were more out of focus and his head was perfectly detailed in focus..</td>', 'Great photo but wish the feathers were more out of focus and his head was perfectly detailed in focus..', '2014-10-25 10:47:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7277135, 1132556, 124982, '<td valign="top">Exceedingly narrow DoF here. Lovely color and detail. Fully expect to see this on the front page.</td>', 'Exceedingly narrow DoF here. Lovely color and detail. Fully expect to see this on the front page.', '2014-10-25 13:20:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7277136, 1132994, 124982, '<td valign="top">I suspect the macro shots are going to steal all the thunder in this challenge. Sad really, since images like this will unfortunately be overlooked. Lovely, intriguing shot!</td>', 'I suspect the macro shots are going to steal all the thunder in this challenge. Sad really, since images like this will unfortunately be overlooked. Lovely, intriguing shot!', '2014-10-25 13:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7277192, 1132922, 124982, '<td valign="top">Certainly not as flashy as most will think when comparing against all the macro shots of insects, but no less attractive or appealing. I absolutely love the warmth in this shot!</td>', 'Certainly not as flashy as most will think when comparing against all the macro shots of insects, but no less attractive or appealing. I absolutely love the warmth in this shot!', '2014-10-25 18:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7277254, 1132983, 50864, '<td valign="top">Lovely blur. I like the smooth darker tones contrasting with the sharper white branches. The centered subject and the bands of dark and lighter tones work very well for me.  The tree is quite beautiful but I feel there is more to this than just the tree. One of my favorites.</td>', 'Lovely blur. I like the smooth darker tones contrasting with the sharper white branches. The centered subject and the bands of dark and lighter tones work very well for me.  The tree is quite beautiful but I feel there is more to this than just the tree. One of my favorites.', '2014-10-26 09:06:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7277255, 1132920, 50864, '<td valign="top">Beautiful  bokeh.</td>', 'Beautiful  bokeh.', '2014-10-26 09:08:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7277256, 1133012, 50864, '<td valign="top">Very lovely.</td>', 'Very lovely.', '2014-10-26 09:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7277257, 1132757, 50864, '<td valign="top">Beautiful</td>', 'Beautiful', '2014-10-26 09:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7277258, 1132898, 50864, '<td valign="top">I think the lens flare makes this lovely image really stand out.</td>', 'I think the lens flare makes this lovely image really stand out.', '2014-10-26 09:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7277259, 1133010, 50864, '<td valign="top">That "one" was a great choice and the capture and processing really picks him (or her ) out. Top pick for me.</td>', 'That "one" was a great choice and the capture and processing really picks him (or her ) out. Top pick for me.', '2014-10-26 09:27:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7277275, 1132883, 13077, '<td valign="top">I like it - funky and visually exciting.</td>', 'I like it - funky and visually exciting.', '2014-10-26 11:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7277277, 1132480, 13077, '<td valign="top">Good shallow-DOF portrait. My guess is a 50mm on full frame, 1.4 or faster? Well lit, very sharp and I like the composition.</td>', 'Good shallow-DOF portrait. My guess is a 50mm on full frame, 1.4 or faster? Well lit, very sharp and I like the composition.', '2014-10-26 11:30:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7277278, 1132679, 13077, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed and I like the tones.</td>', 'Nicely composed and I like the tones.', '2014-10-26 11:30:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7277279, 1132556, 13077, '<td valign="top">Yikes, that''s a close-up! Well composed and excellent focus, and I like the bright colors.</td>', 'Yikes, that''s a close-up! Well composed and excellent focus, and I like the bright colors.', '2014-10-26 11:31:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7277280, 1132544, 13077, '<td valign="top">Very good looking bird, and I like the pose you''ve captured him in.</td>', 'Very good looking bird, and I like the pose you''ve captured him in.', '2014-10-26 11:35:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7277281, 1132589, 13077, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot of a snail, excellent light and colors and meets the challenge well.</td>', 'Beautiful shot of a snail, excellent light and colors and meets the challenge well.', '2014-10-26 11:35:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7277282, 1133002, 13077, '<td valign="top">Captures the feeling of a lazy Sunday very well.</td>', 'Captures the feeling of a lazy Sunday very well.', '2014-10-26 11:36:31.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(7277283, 1132959, 13077, '<td valign="top">I like this, very attractive arrangement, well lit and perfect amount of depth of field.</td>', 'I like this, very attractive arrangement, well lit and perfect amount of depth of field.', '2014-10-26 11:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7277284, 1132833, 13077, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2014-10-26 11:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7277286, 1132692, 13077, '<td valign="top">I like this, the street scene is well shown even though the lady is the only thing in focus, seems like a good editorial type photo.</td>', 'I like this, the street scene is well shown even though the lady is the only thing in focus, seems like a good editorial type photo.', '2014-10-26 11:38:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7277287, 1132967, 13077, '<td valign="top">Good concept.</td>', 'Good concept.', '2014-10-26 11:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7277288, 1132968, 13077, '<td valign="top">Fascinating details here. Very dramatic, good composition and lighting and I like the color scheme.</td>', 'Fascinating details here. Very dramatic, good composition and lighting and I like the color scheme.', '2014-10-26 11:40:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7277289, 1133012, 13077, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and the soft overall look.</td>', 'I like the composition and the soft overall look.', '2014-10-26 11:40:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7277290, 1132906, 13077, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, excellent details and seems like it belongs next to the information about the bird in a dictionary or something.</td>', 'Nicely done, excellent details and seems like it belongs next to the information about the bird in a dictionary or something.', '2014-10-26 11:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7277291, 1132882, 13077, '<td valign="top">Nicely exposed and processed, very attractive colors.</td>', 'Nicely exposed and processed, very attractive colors.', '2014-10-26 11:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7277318, 1132953, 65234, '<td valign="top">Sharp little buglet. Interesting to see which bits of flowers were in the same focal plane as the hover fly, and which we''re not.</td>', 'Sharp little buglet. Interesting to see which bits of flowers were in the same focal plane as the hover fly, and which we''re not.', '2014-10-26 15:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7277319, 1132879, 65234, '<td valign="top">Probably not much missed.  Nice composition.</td>', 'Probably not much missed.  Nice composition.', '2014-10-26 15:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7277320, 1132912, 65234, '<td valign="top">OOF grasses are a nice foil, even with the similarity in color.</td>', 'OOF grasses are a nice foil, even with the similarity in color.', '2014-10-26 15:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7277321, 1132874, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very shallow DOF, which works.  Kind of wish the catchlight were a starburst (which is pretty silly of me).</td>', 'Very shallow DOF, which works.  Kind of wish the catchlight were a starburst (which is pretty silly of me).', '2014-10-26 15:21:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7277322, 1132752, 65234, '<td valign="top">Like fuzzy little claws.</td>', 'Like fuzzy little claws.', '2014-10-26 15:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7277323, 1132961, 65234, '<td valign="top">A classic subject and presentation.  I find myself wanting to rotate the focal plane so the OOF bit pointed right at me is in focus while the rest of the flower fades away.</td>', 'A classic subject and presentation.  I find myself wanting to rotate the focal plane so the OOF bit pointed right at me is in focus while the rest of the flower fades away.', '2014-10-26 15:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7277324, 1132873, 65234, '<td valign="top">Rather like the OOF whiskers, especially the curvy ones.</td>', 'Rather like the OOF whiskers, especially the curvy ones.', '2014-10-26 15:28:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7277330, 1132912, 156466, '<td valign="top">A bit over sharp.</td>', 'A bit over sharp.', '2014-10-26 17:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7277331, 1132962, 156466, '<td valign="top">Would like it a little less soft for the challenge.</td>', 'Would like it a little less soft for the challenge.', '2014-10-26 18:00:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7277332, 1132938, 156466, '<td valign="top">If you could have given us paws all the way to the dude (even shadows) I would have given it more than a 6.</td>', 'If you could have given us paws all the way to the dude (even shadows) I would have given it more than a 6.', '2014-10-26 18:01:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7277333, 1132743, 156466, '<td valign="top">A little too shallow.  Need some real definition on the bee.  What you have is great, but this begs for some focus stacking, or at least some more DoF.</td>', 'A little too shallow.  Need some real definition on the bee.  What you have is great, but this begs for some focus stacking, or at least some more DoF.', '2014-10-26 18:02:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7277334, 1132687, 156466, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but I want something to focus on besides just the stuff in focus.</td>', 'Nice shot, but I want something to focus on besides just the stuff in focus.', '2014-10-26 18:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7277335, 1132934, 156466, '<td valign="top">I need that rim to POP if it''s going to be your focal point.  You got the idea right, but the OOF colors grab me more than the one thing in focus.</td>', 'I need that rim to POP if it''s going to be your focal point.  You got the idea right, but the OOF colors grab me more than the one thing in focus.', '2014-10-26 18:04:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7277336, 1132763, 156466, '<td valign="top">Well captured and processed, just not real attention grabbing.</td>', 'Well captured and processed, just not real attention grabbing.', '2014-10-26 18:05:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7277337, 1132979, 156466, '<td valign="top">Just too soft. Love the feel, but the things that should grab my attention aren''t.</td>', 'Just too soft. Love the feel, but the things that should grab my attention aren''t.', '2014-10-26 18:06:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7277338, 1132544, 156466, '<td valign="top">Love it, but would like some more OOF stuff besides the bird.  Too high key/washed in the background.</td>', 'Love it, but would like some more OOF stuff besides the bird.  Too high key/washed in the background.', '2014-10-26 18:08:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7277339, 1132831, 156466, '<td valign="top">Not crazy about the framing, but otherwise love this.  And yet, it doesn''t sit quite right.  Almost gives the effect that it lives in the middle of the glass, but at the same time the OOF elements in the forward part of the leaves distract too much.  Had you given us EVERYTHING forward of the glass in focus I think - THINK - I would have liked this more.  Still an 8.</td>', 'Not crazy about the framing, but otherwise love this.  And yet, it doesn''t sit quite right.  Almost gives the effect that it lives in the middle of the glass, but at the same time the OOF elements in the forward part of the leaves distract too much.  Had you given us EVERYTHING forward of the glass in focus I think - THINK - I would have liked this more.  Still an 8.', '2014-10-26 18:10:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7277340, 1132929, 156466, '<td valign="top">Lovely, but you HAVE to have that eye in focus.</td>', 'Lovely, but you HAVE to have that eye in focus.', '2014-10-26 18:11:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7277341, 1132822, 156466, '<td valign="top">Over contrasty.  Would love to see this done a little more subtly.</td>', 'Over contrasty.  Would love to see this done a little more subtly.', '2014-10-26 18:11:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7277343, 1132876, 156466, '<td valign="top">I hate that I like this.  Would love to score it higher, but I''m lost as to what''s photo and what''s texture and added bokeh.  Big blotch on the fish cements a 6 on this.</td>', 'I hate that I like this.  Would love to score it higher, but I''m lost as to what''s photo and what''s texture and added bokeh.  Big blotch on the fish cements a 6 on this.', '2014-10-26 18:13:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7277344, 1132967, 156466, '<td valign="top">Needs to be a touch less "disappeared" for me.  And I''m not a fan of the skewing.</td>', 'Needs to be a touch less "disappeared" for me.  And I''m not a fan of the skewing.', '2014-10-26 18:14:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7277346, 1132697, 156466, '<td valign="top">Well taken.  I just don''t think it really grabs you.  I''m thinking color may have been better here, or perhaps a different crop.  It''s a 6 because it just sort of runs into itself.  I think it could have been higher.</td>', 'Well taken.  I just don''t think it really grabs you.  I''m thinking color may have been better here, or perhaps a different crop.  It''s a 6 because it just sort of runs into itself.  I think it could have been higher.', '2014-10-26 18:16:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7277348, 1132641, 156466, '<td valign="top">Even the sharp stuff has my eyes not focusing.  I think you could have grabbed something here, but I''m not a fan of what you have.  Good idea.</td>', 'Even the sharp stuff has my eyes not focusing.  I think you could have grabbed something here, but I''m not a fan of what you have.  Good idea.', '2014-10-26 18:17:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7277349, 1132556, 156466, '<td valign="top">Dang - if you only got those eyes instead of the antennae!!</td>', 'Dang - if you only got those eyes instead of the antennae!!', '2014-10-26 18:17:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7277350, 1132958, 156466, '<td valign="top">Cute</td>', 'Cute', '2014-10-26 18:18:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7277351, 1132846, 156466, '<td valign="top">The glow is a little bothersome to me here, because it softens that one spot at the tip you WANT to be sharp.  Mask off the glow on the tip, and maybe add a touch of vignetting or shadowing in the upper left and this could be a 10.  As is, it''s a 7 for me, because it''s either glowing or purely OOF and <b>nothing</b> is really sharp.</td>', 'The glow is a little bothersome to me here, because it softens that one spot at the tip you WANT to be sharp.  Mask off the glow on the tip, and maybe add a touch of vignetting or shadowing in the upper left and this could be a 10.  As is, it''s a 7 for me, because it''s either glowing or purely OOF and nothing is really sharp.', '2014-10-26 18:21:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7277352, 1132729, 156466, '<td valign="top">Branch feels sharper than the bird.</td>', 'Branch feels sharper than the bird.', '2014-10-26 18:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7277353, 1132960, 156466, '<td valign="top">Love the subtle colors, but the face just doesn''t feel sharp.  I know it is, but it just blends too much.</td>', 'Love the subtle colors, but the face just doesn''t feel sharp.  I know it is, but it just blends too much.', '2014-10-26 18:23:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7277354, 1133007, 156466, '<td valign="top">Love the idea, but the placement of the focal point just is too "off", particularly with the one shoulder at the far left in focus.</td>', 'Love the idea, but the placement of the focal point just is too "off", particularly with the one shoulder at the far left in focus.', '2014-10-26 18:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7277356, 1132589, 156466, '<td valign="top">Ooooo. I want the top of that snail in focus, along with the antennae.  Otherwise it''s lovely.</td>', 'Ooooo. I want the top of that snail in focus, along with the antennae.  Otherwise it''s lovely.', '2014-10-26 18:25:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7277357, 1132880, 156466, '<td valign="top">This needs EVERY bristle end in focus.  The rest doesn''t matter.  Even if you had to fake it.</td>', 'This needs EVERY bristle end in focus.  The rest doesn''t matter.  Even if you had to fake it.', '2014-10-26 18:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7277358, 1132906, 124982, '<td valign="top">Really lovely image, and meets the challenge perfectly. A little noisy for my liking though, particularly in the greens/browns of the background.</td>', 'Really lovely image, and meets the challenge perfectly. A little noisy for my liking though, particularly in the greens/browns of the background.', '2014-10-26 18:26:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7277359, 1132480, 156466, '<td valign="top">Great eyes, but it feels like there''s forced DoF everywhere else.  Unnatural-like.  Could just be razor-thin DoF, but if it is it''s too thin to make it work.</td>', 'Great eyes, but it feels like there''s forced DoF everywhere else.  Unnatural-like.  Could just be razor-thin DoF, but if it is it''s too thin to make it work.', '2014-10-26 18:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7277360, 1132933, 156466, '<td valign="top">Maybe it is.  Too over processed, too much noise and structure.</td>', 'Maybe it is.  Too over processed, too much noise and structure.', '2014-10-26 18:28:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7277363, 1132911, 156466, '<td valign="top">I want to find something wrong, because it doesn''t fell right, but even after doing a screen capture your pipe is perfectly erect. ;)<br/> <br/>Perhaps a bit over-sharp, and the composition might be a little cramped.  It''s well taken, and a 7, but I feel like something in the processing brought it back from a higher score.</td>', 'I want to find something wrong, because it doesn''t fell right, but even after doing a screen capture your pipe is perfectly erect. ;) Perhaps a bit over-sharp, and the composition might be a little cramped.  It''s well taken, and a 7, but I feel like something in the processing brought it back from a higher score.', '2014-10-26 18:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7277365, 1132981, 156466, '<td valign="top">I really love the bokeh.  And I love the feel and colors of this shot.  Given the apparent distance between the leaf and the lights behind it I think this is a better shot with more/all of the leaf in focus.</td>', 'I really love the bokeh.  And I love the feel and colors of this shot.  Given the apparent distance between the leaf and the lights behind it I think this is a better shot with more/all of the leaf in focus.', '2014-10-26 18:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7277366, 1132628, 156466, '<td valign="top">Bring out that eye and soften those streaks.  6</td>', 'Bring out that eye and soften those streaks.  6', '2014-10-26 18:38:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7277368, 1132844, 156466, '<td valign="top">Why does the top of the King look OOF?</td>', 'Why does the top of the King look OOF?', '2014-10-26 18:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7277370, 1132921, 156466, '<td valign="top">It''s like the flash exploded.  Very harsh looking.</td>', 'It''s like the flash exploded.  Very harsh looking.', '2014-10-26 18:41:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7277371, 1132990, 156466, '<td valign="top">I love squirrels, and I love this shot.  Feels a little heavy-handed, and a tad dark.  Looks like the background was softened a lot, but your layer mask brought back in noise near the animal.  The square crop doesn''t do much for me either.  Great capture, but the processing isn''t on mark.  6</td>', 'I love squirrels, and I love this shot.  Feels a little heavy-handed, and a tad dark.  Looks like the background was softened a lot, but your layer mask brought back in noise near the animal.  The square crop doesn''t do much for me either.  Great capture, but the processing isn''t on mark.  6', '2014-10-26 18:44:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7277372, 1132874, 156466, '<td valign="top">Kinda cool, and really nice and sharp, but just a touch too high key for me.</td>', 'Kinda cool, and really nice and sharp, but just a touch too high key for me.', '2014-10-26 18:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7277373, 1132878, 156466, '<td valign="top">That highlight wash under the bigger eye?  It''s what did you in.</td>', 'That highlight wash under the bigger eye?  It''s what did you in.', '2014-10-26 18:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7277374, 1132888, 156466, '<td valign="top">Albino Bull?  My favorite so far, and I hate dogs.  ;)</td>', 'Albino Bull?  My favorite so far, and I hate dogs.  ;)', '2014-10-26 18:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7277376, 1132959, 156466, '<td valign="top">Love the colors, but this is one of those shots where I either want you to soften the OOF areas, or give me all 3.  7</td>', 'Love the colors, but this is one of those shots where I either want you to soften the OOF areas, or give me all 3.  7', '2014-10-26 18:48:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7277377, 1132966, 156466, '<td valign="top">A little front-focused.</td>', 'A little front-focused.', '2014-10-26 18:48:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7277381, 1132994, 74588, '<td valign="top">i can relate to that   10</td>', 'i can relate to that   10', '2014-10-26 19:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7277382, 1132833, 74588, '<td valign="top">uber,super,to see this big must be something else    10</td>', 'uber,super,to see this big must be something else    10', '2014-10-26 19:32:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7277383, 1132657, 74588, '<td valign="top">i feel it   10</td>', 'i feel it   10', '2014-10-26 19:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7277384, 1132968, 74588, '<td valign="top">spectacles?     9</td>', 'spectacles?     9', '2014-10-26 19:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7277385, 1133002, 74588, '<td valign="top">lovely   9</td>', 'lovely   9', '2014-10-26 19:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7277386, 1133010, 74588, '<td valign="top">beautiful   9</td>', 'beautiful   9', '2014-10-26 19:34:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7277387, 1132822, 74588, '<td valign="top">funny,i like it   9</td>', 'funny,i like it   9', '2014-10-26 19:34:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7277388, 1132938, 74588, '<td valign="top">nice concept   8</td>', 'nice concept   8', '2014-10-26 19:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7277389, 1132892, 74588, '<td valign="top">strong pic   8</td>', 'strong pic   8', '2014-10-26 19:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7277390, 1132898, 74588, '<td valign="top">so dreamy   8</td>', 'so dreamy   8', '2014-10-26 19:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7277391, 1132983, 74588, '<td valign="top">beautiful   8</td>', 'beautiful   8', '2014-10-26 19:36:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7277398, 1132898, 112739, '<td valign="top">The winner in my book! Just love this!</td>', 'The winner in my book! Just love this!', '2014-10-26 20:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7277399, 1132906, 112739, '<td valign="top">I have this as the Red Ribbon. Wonderfully clean and brilliant. Thank you for not over processing.</td>', 'I have this as the Red Ribbon. Wonderfully clean and brilliant. Thank you for not over processing.', '2014-10-26 20:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7277400, 1132480, 112739, '<td valign="top">I voted this an 8. A little more light on the face would have been a 9. A little more contrast would have been a 10.</td>', 'I voted this an 8. A little more light on the face would have been a 9. A little more contrast would have been a 10.', '2014-10-26 20:33:02.000000', NULL, 1),
