(7277877, 1132544, 163081, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by soup:</b></div><hr/><i> folks looking for bokah.  when shallow is present in abundance here. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks for this comment. I was wondering the same why so many people don''t know photography techniques and only looking for the bokeh effect(which is pretty easy to get) but taking a shot without the bokeh and WITH a shallow depth of field is so much more difficult. I think this really fits the challenge and is IMO a superb picture that should have had better votes.</td>', 'Originally posted by soup: folks looking for bokah.  when shallow is present in abundance here.   Thanks for this comment. I was wondering the same why so many people don''t know photography techniques and only looking for the bokeh effect(which is pretty easy to get) but taking a shot without the bokeh and WITH a shallow depth of field is so much more difficult. I think this really fits the challenge and is IMO a superb picture that should have had better votes.', '2014-10-27 22:57:49.000000', NULL, 0),
