(7278207, 1132898, 156466, '<td valign="top">I need to post a comment thanking the Committee for not DQing me over some very ancillary branches I cloned out.  I half-expected one going in, and was prepared for it.  Then, when I actually won the challenge, I was thinking, "Yep, I finally win, and I get my first DQ!!", so from the bottom of my heart, thank you for being reasonable.  I promise to hold back my next 1 1/2 complaints.  <br/> <br/>:)</td>', 'I need to post a comment thanking the Committee for not DQing me over some very ancillary branches I cloned out.  I half-expected one going in, and was prepared for it.  Then, when I actually won the challenge, I was thinking, "Yep, I finally win, and I get my first DQ!!", so from the bottom of my heart, thank you for being reasonable.  I promise to hold back my next 1 1/2 complaints.   :)', '2014-10-29 17:39:29.000000', NULL, 0),
